\item[S1] ULAM.AI and the UnsolvedMath Contributors, UnsolvedMath: A Curated Collection of Open Mathematics Problems, record 5300049 (AMR-052-0049). CC BY 4.0. \url{https://huggingface.co/datasets/ulamai/UnsolvedMath}.
\item[S2] Feliks Przytycki, ``On Invariant Measures for Iterations of Holomorphic Maps'', in Ben Bielefeld and Mikhail Lyubich (eds.), Problems in Holomorphic Dynamics (1992), Problem 1.2, pp. 30; arXiv:math/9205209v1. \url{https://arxiv.org/pdf/math/9205209}.
